  "_README": [
    "Anemia at the Kraiss sVQI-FS threshold: sex-specific, haemoglobin",
    "< 13 g/dL in males or < 12 g/dL in females (1 point).",
    "",
    "Four criteria = {male, female} x {g/dL, g/L}, OR'd. Each pairs a",
    "ValueAsNumber threshold with a Gender demographic criterion, which is how",
    "circe expresses what query_anemia_covariate_counts(sex_specific = TRUE)",
    "does with a CASE on person.gender_concept_id.",
    "",
    "See cohort 9100008's note on why this is a separate cohort.",
    "PrimaryCriteriaLimit / QualifiedLimit / ExpressionLimit are all \"All\" and EndStrategy is StartDate+0, unlike the [DVI] VA-FI cohorts (1797948-1797977) which are \"First\". A first-ever-only cohort cannot answer a lookback-window question."
